msgid "**Tier 1 translation engines** are directly maintained by the project maintainers. Although the maintainers do **not use this project regularly**, they will rely on GitHub issues to identify problems. When any of these engines encounter issues, the maintainers will fix them as soon as possible to ensure stability and reliability.\n\n\nCurrently supported Tier 1 translation engines include:"
msgstr "- [DeepL](https://www.deepl.com/translator)\n- [Google Translate](https://translate.google.com/)\n- [Azure](https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/products/ai-services/ai-translator)\n- [Baidu](https://fanyi.baidu.com/)\n- [Youdao](https://fanyi.youdao.com/)\n- [GPT](https://openai.com/index/openai-api/)\n- [Ollama](https://ollama.ai/)\n- [OpenAI](https://openai.com/index/openai-api/)\n- [Gemini](https://deepmind.google/technologies/gemini/)\n- [Claude](https://claude.ai/)\n- [Qianfan](https://cloud.baidu.com/product/wenzin/)\n- [ZhiPu](https://open.bigmodel.cn/)\n\n---\n\n### OUTPUT LANGUAGE\n\npt\n\n---\n\nLet's think step by step and then complete the task.\n- **Motores de tradução Tier 1** são mantidos diretamente pelos mantenedores do projeto. Embora os mantenedores **não usem este projeto regularmente**, eles confiarão em problemas do GitHub para identificar problemas. Quando qualquer um desses motores encontrar problemas, os mantenedores os corrigirão o mais rápido possível para garantir estabilidade e confiabilidade.\n\nAtualmente, os motores de tradução Tier 1 suportados incluem:\n\n- [DeepL](https://www.deepl.com/translator)\n- [Google Translate](https://translate.google.com/)\n- [Azure](https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/products/ai-services/ai-translator)\n- [Baidu](https://fanyi.baidu.com/)\n- [Youdao](https://fanyi.youdao.com/)\n- [GPT](https://openai.com/index/openai-api/)\n- [Ollama](https://ollama.ai/)\n- [OpenAI](https://openai.com/index/openai-api/)\n- [Gemini](https://deepmind.google/technologies/gemini/)\n- [Claude](https://claude.ai/)\n- [Qianfan](https://cloud.baidu.com/product/wenzin/)\n- [ZhiPu](https://open.bigmodel.cn/)"

